Z||000004||2M4 Dale||04-10-2000||10:50 AM||||Hey Stimpy...don't go !!! There are too many folks here for everyone to get along like best friends. Don't you find it interesting that for as many as disagree there are as many who do. Nobody can please everybody 100% of the time. I don't street race any more but I used to be a terror...had a couple bad fast GTO's in my day. This is not politicaly correct behavior anymore so you just gotta know that some members are gonna give the street racers some sh!t. But if you are really gonna leave I'm sure there are many of us who will miss you. (including me). And we don't agree on everything...remember the infamous post in the off topic section. Be Good and Fieros Forever !!!||||reg||9
