Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||04-10-2000||03:18 PM||||Man, we need to do something about the time-difference. Another thread I missed and one that obviously stirred things up quite a bit again...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I haven't read the thread that caused this (please, don't make me monitor every single thread on this forum - I might as well just close it then) but if you are being bullied (or feel you're being bullied), don't walk away from the forum, just walk away from those whom you feel you are being bullied by...<P>I suspect a member's "kill" thread started this. I've read the original message and although I frowned upon it, I gave this person the benefit of the doubt that he knew what he was doing and that he didn't put anyone in danger. We all engage in the occasional race, I know I do. And I'm pretty sure that if I would put some of my stories here on the forum, I would get flamed for irresponsible behavior. Was I ever irresponsible then? No. Am I sure? Yes. But it's typical a "you had to be there so you would know" kind of thing. And that's why I choose not to participate in these kill-threads. Because I wasn't there, and I could therefor never judge the situation - nor the people involved... So although I do have my thoughts, I choose to keep them for myself.||||reg||1
