Z||000010||dodger||04-11-2000||12:17 AM||||Stimpy...<BR>You did me a great service. I'm new to Fieros and to this forum, and a mechanical klutz. You steered me to George at the Fiero Shop and I joined Golden Gate Fieros. George saved me a lot of money already, and came 80 miles to pick me up when I broke down on HWY 1. I met your dad at a meeting, and almost made it to the Modesto show. My girlfriend is even now considering buying a Fiero from the Fiero Shop. If it were not for you I would still be "contributing to the Mr. Goodwrench retirement fund", as you put it. <P>I watch lots of the threads in the forum every day. I learn plenty about the cars. There are people in here that I would never associate with, and some who could become friends. The only thing everyone has in common is an interest in an economical performance car. <P>Anyway, you helped me a LOT...!<BR> ||||reg||1
