Z||000015||stimpy||04-11-2000||07:55 PM||||Alright, I'll admit it, I'm addicted to this forum and I'd probably rather give up my favorite sneakers then never log on again.  I have learned some valuable lessons:<P>1, You like me, you really like me! Seriously, I appreciate the kind words and encouragement through my little dark moment.<P>2. Xanax is goood! I really do need to learn to take a chill occasionally and NOT get nvolved in pissing contests.  It ain't life and death.<P>3. Keep a low profile. I made an error in fighting a lost cause for someone who turned out to be somewhat of a weasel. Boy, did I look stupid! Thanks V.<P>4. As was excellently illustrated in the fine John Candy vehicle Canadian Bacon...There is NOTHING to be gained in going to war with Canada. If my unnamed foe reads this, PLEASE do not post a response, just accept my surrender and know that I will NEVER again post on the same thread as you. <BR>As for all my friends, thanks for not saying good riddence. Let's keep having fun and get on with the party!<p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 04-11-2000).]||||reg||14
